// variance mismatch — expected &'a Vec<&'a i64>, got &'a Vec<&'static i64>" and "call to 'count' arg 2: variance
// mismatch — expected &'static i64". sema's compute_variances derives the parameter from the stdlib Vec's `*mut T`
// field, which is invariant (correctly, for a raw pointer). Found 2026-09-14b-ptrcoerceland (Q01S, Q11P, Q17),
